Z||000017||isthiswhereiputausername?||08-10-2001||11:31 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LT1 Chop Top:<BR><B>usually not Harley owners.......they have to hang on due to excessive vibration and fear of falling off.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LOL!!<P><BR>PS..MinnGreenGT, <BR>I printed out some of the cards on business card paper and they are great to hand out..<P>Theres a girl (yes, shes hot  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">),that works next door, she drives a 84SC..looks to be in good shape.. I still need to get over and give her a card  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by isthiswhereiputausername? (edited 08-10-2001).]||||reg||1
