Z||000019||cdunn||08-10-2001||12:10 PM||||I saw a red 88 coupe in richmond last week. I stopped and was looking at it. The seats were covered in denim a bar was accross the clothes hooks with denim curtains in the back window. A young lady comes out to get in her car and looks at me like i'm a stalker as I question her about her car(and i wasn't even rubbing myself this time) a couple days later i'm driving my 01 dodge coupe to take a movie back i come back to the car and there is a red avenger parked next to me and some guy looking at it like it just fell out of a space ship i try to get in the car and he is on me like a chicken on a june bug wanting to know if i had the 3.0  i finally tell him i have to go(i had to fight back the urge to tell him i had ice cream melting in the trunk)he tells me i should lower it and put a viper nitro kit on it. Hell, it only has 600 miles on it plus i wouldnt want to tell my wife i put nitro on the family(her) car||||reg||10
